' purpose: bounded, folded package claims as unauthenticated metadata only
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/package-claims.mjs
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/package-claims.test.mjs
' context: _spec/_plans/ml-runtime-redesign.md section 33 owns qualification scope.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
left to right direction
title Package claims — bounded Deb822 fields, not provenance
actor "Registered reader\nprivate bytes after FD closure" as CALLER <<host>>
component "package-claims.mjs\nselectPackageClaims" as PARSER <<app>>
component "Frozen selected claims\nxz-utils / liblzma5 / libc6" as CLAIMS <<app>>
component "PackageClaimError\nfixed E_PACKAGE" as ERROR <<error>>
CALLER ARROW_MAIN PARSER : native byte view; lower-only input ceiling
PARSER ARROW_MAIN PARSER : private snapshot / fatal UTF-8 / Deb822 folding
PARSER ARROW_MAIN CLAIMS : whitelisted fields; validate complete folded values
CLAIMS ARROW_MAIN CALLER : claims only; never software-authentication authority
PARSER ARROW_ERROR ERROR : invalid input/format, duplicate or exceeded cap
ERROR ARROW_ERROR CALLER : no partial result
note bottom of PARSER
Input<=4MiB; paragraphs<=4096
Paragraph<=128KiB; selected value<=512 bytes
Continuations join their preceding field
No shared/resizable backing or input views
end note
note bottom of CLAIMS
Only six selected fields for three packages
Unknown fields do not escape
No filesystem, network, process or reader API
Package claims never authenticate installed bytes
end note
@enduml
